dden":false,"talkIds":[7408702,7408703],"talks":[{"talkId":7408702,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7408702","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7408702,"initDialog":740870201,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[5259,21084],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Fontaine_74053/Q7408702","priority":6,"questId":74087,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":740870201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5259,"speakerName":"Chronie","textMapHash":4172747218,"text":"Is this where researchers spent their downtime? Is this even humane? Has the Fontaine Research Institute ever considered making renovating this place a priority?","nextNodeIds":[740870202]},{"nodeId":740870202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":3314908770,"text":"...There should be a Survey Anchor here. Just like Ms. Chronie implied, this place needs renovation, and the power supply here is very limited... Or perhaps I should say, there's a complete shortage.","nextNodeIds":[740870203]},{"nodeId":740870203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":2584168362,"text":"#While I'm answering Ms. Chronie's questions, I'll leave the job of recovering the Survey Anchor to you, {NICKNAME}.","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7408703,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7408702","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7408703,"initDialog":740870301,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[21084,5259],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Fontaine_74053/Q7408703","priority":5,"questId":74087,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":740870301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":1953872146,"text":"Compared to some other areas, the dormitories weren't impacted as much by the explosion.","nextNodeIds":[740870302]},{"nodeId":740870302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5259,"speakerName":"Chronie","textMapHash":3112850082,"text":"Dormitories? But I don't see even one bed here, so how do the researchers get any rest? It's not like they can sleep in chairs, right?","nextNodeIds":[740870303]},{"nodeId":740870303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":3696702714,"text":"Ms. Chronie, your idea of \"resting\" is very different from that of the researchers.","nextNodeIds":[740870304]},{"nodeId":740870304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":525478722,"text":"When a researcher at the Fontaine Research Institute says they need rest, they only want a quick break for their brain.","nextNodeIds":[740870305]},{"nodeId":740870305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":144266346,"text":"Then, they would usually come here, play piano, read, and have a drink or two if necessary.","nextNodeIds":[740870306]},{"nodeId":740870306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5259,"speakerName":"Chronie","textMapHash":3679620474,"text":"Uh, but wouldn't sleeping provide more rest for the brain?","nextNodeIds":[740870307]},{"nodeId":740870307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":3537142322,"text":"You may be correct, but... To our researchers, sleeping is a waste of time in the first place.","nextNodeIds":[740870308]},{"nodeId":740870308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5259,"speakerName":"Chronie","textMapHash":1123380026,"text":"Sleeping is a waste of time? No, it is essential for rest!","nextNodeIds":[740870309]},{"nodeId":740870309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":601948802,"text":"Sleeping completely cuts your train of thought short, and that's just not acceptable for our research work.","nextNodeIds":[740870310,740870311]},{"nodeId":740870310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3035249650,"text":"(Keep listening...)","nextNodeIds":[740870312]},{"nodeId":740870312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5259,"speakerName":"Chronie","textMapHash":1119384914,"text":"Are you being serious? If you don't sleep, the only thing that'll be cut short is your life!","nextNodeIds":[740870313]},{"nodeId":740870313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":2949470914,"text":"Not necessarily. The institute boasts an excellent health care system that guarantees researchers' health and well-being.","nextNodeIds":[740870314]},{"nodeId":740870314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5259,"speakerName":"Chronie","textMapHash":832469874,"text":"But that's still no reason to not sleep!","nextNodeIds":[740870315]},{"nodeId":740870315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5259,"speakerName":"Chronie","textMapHash":3338413642,"text":"Also, if researchers are here to give their brains a break, wouldn't that break their thought process from research, anyway?","nextNodeIds":[740870316]},{"nodeId":740870316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":950635426,"text":"Not necessarily. It only seems like they're taking a break when actually, they're still pondering different academic subjects subconsciously.","nextNodeIds":[740870317]},{"nodeId":740870317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":4262802042,"text":"It's akin to a vast ocean that, while appearing calm on the surface, still has a strong undercurrent beneath.","nextNodeIds":[740870318]},{"nodeId":740870318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":1924136322,"text":"Sometimes, the undercurrents below are much stronger than the towering waves above.","nextNodeIds":[740870319]},{"nodeId":740870319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5259,"speakerName":"Chronie","textMapHash":2561180202,"text":"I get it. You mean when researchers of the Fontaine Research Institute are on a project, they must keep working and are not allowed to rest, right?","nextNodeIds":[740870320]},{"nodeId":740870320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":1196109826,"text":"That is not completely fair to say. If they truly need sleep, they're free to go back home and do just that.","nextNodeIds":[740870321]},{"nodeId":740870321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5259,"speakerName":"Chronie","textMapHash":2393228378,"text":"So, it is fairer to say that as long as researchers of the Fontaine Research Institute are inside the Institute, they must keep working and are not allowed to rest.","nextNodeIds":[740870322]},{"nodeId":740870322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21084,"speakerName":"Nacker","textMapHash":2402609346,"text":"Your rhetoric is simply astound, Ms. Chronie.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":740870311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3222161034,"text":"(Quit listening...)","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7408702,0],"PAINLIBB